The source was imported from the gpui-pre 0.3.9 crates, a snapshot of
zed-industries/zed@93d745668805029476e6d7fbb19652116fed51de.

GM modified this distribution to prefer Vulkan with an OpenGL fallback,
allocate path textures lazily, load fontconfig fonts on demand, support
opt-in fixed-size uniform lists, and resolve sibling crates from this fork.
Additional changes provide dependency locking, layout tests, patch records,
and CI checks. See OMARCHY-PATCHES.md and the git history for attribution.
